{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55051","headline":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官爻动，却在内爻兴。\n若在子孙傍发动，未（辛本、川本作「虽」）来攻我不曾赢，彼败怎回程？\n（凡占战，世爲我，应爲他；内爲我，外爲他；子爲我，官爲他；比和者吉。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}